msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr ""
"<b>Privacy policy</b>\n"
"\n"
"We use Telegram profile data, such as ID, display name, language, and username, to create a profile, process orders, top-ups, and support requests.\n"
"\n"
"Payment data is processed by payment providers. The bot stores only technical order and payment information required for the service to work.\n"
"\n"
"We do not sell personal data to third parties. Data may be shared only with services required for bot operation, payments, analytics, security, and support.\n"
"\n"
"For data-related questions, contact support."

